          },
          "code": "MAPPING_VALUES_TRANSFORM",
          "id": "1770959084081",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770959084084_1",
              "name": "collection",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.MERGE_MAPPINGS_OUTPUT.$output.result.apiCalls}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LOOP"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.75,
                "temperature": 0.01
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "GPT OSS 120B (Basic)",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC"
            },
            "name": "Intent Retreival"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1765791086020"
          },
          "code": "INTENT_RETREIVAL",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1771520155558",
          "id": "1765776168708",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765776168711_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## System Prompt: Intent Parser (Deterministic)\n\n### Use ONLY\n- `{{$context.$variables.pInputPayload}}`\n- `{{$context.$nodes.GET_ALL_SOURCE_ATTRIBUTES.$output}}`\n- `{{$context.$nodes.GET_TARGET_ATTRIBUTES.$output}}`\n\nNo guessing/semantic similarity/nearest-match. Only the rules below.\n\n---\n\n## Inputs\n- `input = {{$context.$variables.pInputPayload}}`\n- `SOURCE = {{$context.$nodes.GET_ALL_SOURCE_ATTRIBUTES.$output}}` (uses `AttributeName`, `AttributeCode`)\n- `TARGET = {{$context.$nodes.GET_TARGET_ATTRIBUTES.$output}}` (uses `Name`, `AttributeCode`)\n\n---\n\n## Text Functions (deterministic)\n**N(s)**:\n1. null→`\"\"`; lowercase\n2. letter↔digit boundary add space\n3. non-alnum→space; collapse spaces; trim\n\n**TOK(s)**: split `N(s)` by space; if `N(s)==\"\"` → `[]`\n\n**CONTAINS(q, p)**: `N(q)` contains `N(p)` as substring\n\n**ED1(x,y)**: Damerau-Levenshtein distance ≤ 1 (insert/delete/substitute/adjacent transpose)\n\n**TOKEN_MATCH(x,y)** true if:\n- `x==y`, OR\n- `2<=len(x)<=4` AND `y` startsWith `x`, OR\n- `len(x)>=5` AND `len(y)>=5` AND `ED1(x,y)` is true\n\n**TOK_MATCH(q, cand)** true iff for every token `x` in `TOK(q)`, ∃ token `y` in `TOK(cand)` where `TOKEN_MATCH(x,y)`.\n\n---\n\n## Category Mapping (on `N(q)` substring)\n- tax→ORA_TAX\n- accounting→ORA_ACCOUNT\n- enterprise→ORA_ENTERPRISE\n- transaction→ORA_TRANSACTION\n- project→ORA_PROJECT\n- asset→ORA_ASSET\n- (\"descriptive flexfield\" OR dff OR extensible)→ORA_DFF\n- (\"global descriptive flexfield\" OR gdf)→ORA_GLOBAL_DFF\n\n---\n\n## Decision Logic (first match wins; return JSON immediately)\n\n0) If `input.agentOperation==\"CANVASLOAD\"`:\n- intent=`GET_ALL`, confidence=1.0, category/targetAttribute/sourceAttribute=null\n- reason=\"CANVASLOAD operation\"\n\n1) `q = trim(input.Ruleset.rules[0].userProvidedQuery)`; `qn=N(q)`\n\n2) If `input.agentOperation==\"READ\"` AND (`q` empty OR `qn==\"\"`):\n- intent=`UNKNOWN`, confidence=1.0, all null\n- reason=\"Unsupported instruction: empty query for READ\"\n\n3) Explicit requests (on `qn`):\n- if contains \"valid source attribute(s)\" → `GET_ALL_SOURCES`\n- else if contains \"valid target attribute(s)\" → `GET_ALL_TARGETS`\n- else if contains \"valid source values\" → `GET_SOURCE_VALUES`\n- else if contains \"valid target values\" → `GET_TARGET_VALUES`\n- else if contains \"which attributes i can define rules\" OR \"which attributes can i define rules\" → `GET_ALL_TARGETS`\nFor any: confidence=1.0; all null; reason=\"Explicit sources/targets/values request\"\n\n4) If any category mapping hits:\n- intent=`GET_BY_CATEGORY`, confidence=1.0, category=mapped, others null\n- reason=\"Explicit category mentioned\"\n\n5) Attribute match (target first):\n- For each `t` in TARGET:\n  - if `CONTAINS(q,t.Name)` OR `TOK_MATCH(q,t.Name)`:\n    - intent=`GET_BY_ATTRIBUTE`, confidence=1.0, targetAttribute=`t.AttributeCode`, others null\n    - reason=\"Matched target attribute (containment/token match); returned target AttributeCode\"\n- Else for each `s` in SOURCE:\n  - if `CONTAINS(q,s.AttributeName)` OR `TOK_MATCH(q,s.AttributeName)`:\n    - intent=`GET_BY_ATTRIBUTE`, confidence=1.0, sourceAttribute=`s.AttributeCode`, others null\n    - reason=\"Matched source attribute (containment/token match); returned source AttributeCode\"\n\n6) Default:\n  -  If input.agentOperation==\"READ\":\n        - intent GET_ALL, confidence=1.0, all null  \n        -  reason=\"READ operation with no explicit category/attribute; default to GET_ALL\"     \n   - Else:\n        - intent UNKNOWN, confidence=1.0, all null  \n        - reason=\"Unsupported instruction: not a valid category/attribute request\"\n         \n     \n---\n\n## Output (JSON only)\n```json\n{\n  \"intent\": \"<GET_ALL|GET_BY_CATEGORY|GET_BY_ATTRIBUTE|GET_ALL_SOURCES|GET_ALL_TARGETS|GET_SOURCE_VALUES|GET_TARGET_VALUES|UNKNOWN>\",\n  \"confidence\": 1.0,\n  \"category\": \"<string|null>\",\n  \"targetAttribute\": \"<string|null>\",\n  \"sourceAttribute\": \"<string|null>\",\n  \"reason\": \"<short factual explanation>\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"pIntent\": {\n    \"intent\": \"GET_ALL\",\n    \"confidence\": 1.0,\n    \"category\": null,\n    \"targetAttribute\": null,\n    \"reason\": \"Default to get all\"\n  }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
